[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A  • \u001b[1mVerification & CLI Cheat Sheet\u001b[m: \u001b]8;id=jk39f31cec0f36451e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/tutorial/reference/verification-and-cli-cheatsheet.html\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m/\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mf\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m/\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mv\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mf\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaf5733c6db9b6b55;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/tutoria"]
[0.000, "o", "l/reference/verification-and-cli-cheatsheet.md\u0007tutorial/reference/verification-and-cli-cheatsheet.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Modern Web Guidance\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mdark-mode\u001b[m: I declared \u001b[94m<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\">\u001b[m in \u001b[94m<head>\u001b[m and applied \u001b[94mcolor-scheme: dark\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m\r\n  (with a \u001b[94m@media print\u001b[m override to \u001b[94mcolor-scheme: light\u001b[m) so viewport scrollbars and native controls match the dark\r\n  theme without flashes (\"Apply the \u001b[94mcolor-scheme\u001b[m property to the \u001b[94mhtml\u001b[m element or the \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m pseudo-class.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mcustomize-scrollbar-color-and-thickness\u001b[m: I paired \u001b[94mscrollbar-color\u001b[m with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width: thin\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m and\r\n  scrollable code/table containers to ensure custom scrollbars render on macOS, and gated \u001b[94m::-webkit-scrollbar\u001b[m\r\n  fallbacks behind \u001b[94m@supports not (scrollbar-color: auto)\u001b[m (\"Wrap legacy fallbacks in an \u001b[94m@supports not (scrollbar-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mcolor: auto)\u001b[m block to prevent conflicts between"]
[0.000, "o", " standard properties and legacy WebKit selectors in browsers that\r\n  support both natively.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mcross-document-transitions\u001b[m: I enabled multi-page view transitions inside \u001b[94m@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mpreference)\u001b[m via \u001b[94m@view-transition { navigation: auto; }\u001b[m so navigating between lessons respects motion preferences\r\n  (\"Both the source and destination pages must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on\r\n  navigation.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mbrand-consistent-forms\u001b[m: I set \u001b[94maccent-color: var(--accent-color)\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m with a high-contrast sky-blue token\r\n  (\u001b[94m#38bdf8\u001b[m) and added a \u001b[94m@supports not (accent-color: var(--accent-color))\u001b[m fallback for verification checkboxes (\"You\r\n  MUST use the \u001b[94m@supports not\u001b[m rule to apply custom fallback styles only when \u001b[94maccent-color\u001b[m is not supported.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I structured every page with semantic landmarks (\u001b[94m<header>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<nav>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<main>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<ar"]
[0.000, "o", "ticle>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<footer>\u001b[m),\r\n  \u001b[94m<th scope=\"col\">\u001b[m table headers, a \u001b[94m.visually-hidden:where(:not(:focus-within, :active))\u001b[m skip link targeting \u001b[94m<h1\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mid=\"main-heading\" tabindex=\"-1\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m:focus-visible\u001b[m outlines with \u001b[94moutline-offset: 2px\u001b[m, and separate \u001b[94mkeydown\u001b[m (\u001b[94mEnter\u001b[m) /\r\n  \u001b[94mkeyup\u001b[m (\u001b[94mSpace\u001b[m) handlers on margin-note triggers (\"When implementing a custom keyboard handler for button-like\r\n  elements, Enter should be a \u001b[94mkeydown\u001b[m handler and Space should be a \u001b[94mkeyup\u001b[m handler\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94massets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, layout, components, simulators, utilities, print;\u001b[m\r\n  priority zones without global \u001b[94m*\u001b[m resets, and used \u001b[94m:has(:checked)\u001b[m and \u001b[94m:not(:last-child)\u001b[m to express state and layout\r\n  intent cleanly (\"\u001b[1mDO NOT\u001b[m use global resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they cannot be overridden by web components or lower-\r\n  priority cascade layers (without \u001b[94m!important\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", ").\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mtypography\u001b[m: I used \u001b[94mrem\u001b[m and \u001b[94mclamp()\u001b[m for fluid headings, unitless \u001b[94mline-height: 1.65\u001b[m, a \u001b[94m68ch–70ch\u001b[m prose measure,\r\n  \u001b[94mtext-wra\u001b[m\r\n⡿  \u001b[90mGener\u001b[94mating\u001b[90m...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: In /diff, press c to add inline comments and send them as feedback.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
