[0.000, "o", "p()\u001b[m for fluid headings, unitless \u001b[94mline-height: 1.65\u001b[m, a \u001b[94m68ch–70ch\u001b[m prose measure,\r\n  \u001b[94mtext-wrap: balance\u001b[m on headings/table headers, and \u001b[94mtext-wrap: pretty\u001b[m on body copy (\"Use \u001b[94mtext-wrap: balance\u001b[m for\r\n  balanced headlines and headline-like content (e.g. \u001b[94m<th>\u001b[m)\").\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m Run `tutorial/.venv/bin/python .agents/skills/teach-code/scripts/sync_listing.py --root tutorial --check` and\r\n  `tutorial/.venv/bin/python tutorial/build.py --out-dir tutorial/_site --check`, remove temporary `tutorial/_site/`,\r\n  verify `tutorial/.gitignore` excludes `.venv/`, `_site/`, generated `*.html`, and compiled test binari"]
